Americans are desperate to restore government by and for the people, not the privileged and powerful.

We need leadership that carries that responsibility in their heart and gut.

@ChrisVanHollen is that leader. I've seen him rally support for the people against the powerful time https://t.co/QsPB5qvlrH

I refuse to let the U.S. sleepwalk into a dangerous nuclear deal with Saudi Arabia. The law gives Congress the power to review and block a deal like this.

@SenMarkey and I are making sure the Senate fulfills that responsibility before it’s too late.
